## First light

::vfx{type="whiteout"}
@narrator: The grey at the windows turns to white. You run for the lobby, and the lobby is a ward, and the ward is full.
@narrator: Twelve beds. Eleven of them are occupied. The twelfth has been turned down for you, the corner folded back just so.
@maud: There you are, dear. We were starting to worry.
@tobias{when="@withToby"}: Nell? Nell, why are you getting in? Nell!
::set{run.fate = "lost"}
::set{user.deaths += 1}
@narrator: Outside, a car sits in the ambulance bay with its driver's door open until the battery dies.
